\begin{example}[The Euclidean Connection]
\label{ex:euclidean-connection}
\dcref{ch4:4.8}
On $T\mathbb R^n$, the formula (4.3) defines the Euclidean connection $\bar\nabla$; its standard-frame coefficients are zero.
\end{example}

